# Prettier exclusions for the site repository.
#
# The site is its own repository, so its formatter has its own surface: the
# build output it commits, the dependencies, the generated icon set, and the
# monorepo checkout it builds from. A file in one of those trees is either
# produced by a script or owned by another repository, and reformatting it
# would break a byte check or dirty a checkout that is not this repository's.

# Dependencies
node_modules

# The built site. `Target/` is committed because it is what users receive, so
# it must stay exactly as the build wrote it.
Target

# The monorepo checkout the build reads. It is a second, full copy of the
# source repository (13,781 files) and formatting it would dirty that
# checkout, make `Module/DeepSeek` show as modified content, and block
# `git submodule update`.
Module/DeepSeek
Module/DeepSeek/**

# The generated icon set and the generated market index. `Scripts/Prepare.ts`
# copies the icons out of the monorepo before the build and the monorepo's
# generator writes the index; both are byte-checked, and prettier would break
# that check.
Public/Icon
Public/marketplace.json

# Lockfiles and the generated type cache.
pnpm-lock.yaml
.astro
